n spaceship with no past memories.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the protagonist, you must <strong>navigate</strong> the creepy halls of this spaceship, piecing together parts of your<strong> lost memories</strong> while <strong>uncovering</strong> the disturbing truth about your <strong>abduction</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you will find unusual lifeforms, and hidden mysteries that will help you discover the dark experiments carried out by the alien species.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every step closer to the truth will expose the evil forces at work and your role in the bigger mystery, which could decide the fate of both humans and the alien species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514490/extras/Gun.gif?t=1739287668\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514490/extras/World.png?t=1739287668\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will <strong>explore</strong> this massive <strong>interconnected</strong> spaceship filled with enemies, secrets, weapons and lore items. The world contains many areas including a creepy, infected zone filled with blood and strange, pulsing walls, a sleek, high-tech corridor with bright lights and metal panels, a vibrant, overgrown area full of plants and natural sounds, and many more that will add depth and excitement to the adventure, making each new space feel fresh and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514490/extras/Map.gif?t=1739287668\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WISHLIST NOW &lt;3</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514490/extras/Wishlist.gif?t=1739287668\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514490/extras/Itch_DividerV.png?t=1739287668\" /></p>","developers":["Rohan Patel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1514490/header.jpg?t=1739287668","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.9+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2,6 GHz Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX9<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257077492,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077492/movie480.mp4?t=1737134751","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077492/movie_max.mp4?t=1737134751"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257077492/dfe17af372b11674bb5af25708bef0cfba6c2e17/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737134751","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077492/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1737134751","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077492/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1737134751"}}],"name":"Hippoxxus","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/Vista/8/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.66 G